                "1. **Spatial Feature Extraction (CNN)**\n",
                "   - Conv1D layers extract features from the 128-channel spatial distribution\n",
                "   - Batch normalization prevents overfitting\n",
                "   - MaxPooling reduces dimensionality\n",
